        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CSA12, 12\" Solid Brass Window Casement  Stay Adjuster</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCasement stay adjusters hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. Totally adjustable, a tightening knob holds the window in place anywhere on the arm, so it will never wear out and loose friction. This 12 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. The contemporary design makes it perfect for any house. It is slim enough that it will not steal the show from the view outside the window, but those who do notice it, will see the sleek style. It is available in 8 high quality finishes and packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CSA12-Specifications.gif?v=1704354644\" width=\"600\" height=\"253\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CSA12 Window Casement Stay Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-10-inch-window-casement-stay-adjuster-deltana-csa10\"><b>10\"  Casement Stay</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CSA12 12\" Casement Stay:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rod Length:12\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Sash Plate: 2-1/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sill Plate: 1-3/4\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CSA12.pdf?v=1691095313\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  CSA12 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 12 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster, Deltana CSA12",
                "description": "12\" Casement Window Stay Deltana CSA12 - Casement stay adjusters hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. Totally adjustable, a tightening knob holds the window in place anywhere on the arm, so it will never wear out and loose friction. This 12 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. The contemporary design makes it perfect for any house. It is slim enough that it will not steal the show from the view outside the window, but those who do notice it, will see the sleek style. It is available in 8 high quality finishes and packaged with mounting hardware.",
